WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.637 --> 00:00:03.477
Verifying product pairs against a receipt

2
00:00:03.477 --> 00:00:07.610
Pick the pairs you bought on this receipt

3
00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:12.412
Then scan the receipt

4
00:00:12.412 --> 00:00:17.397
For each product, the app suggests the receipt line it was bought on

5
00:00:17.397 --> 00:00:22.034
Select the line, and confirm it

6
00:00:22.034 --> 00:00:27.467
Save, and every pair on the receipt is verified

7
00:00:27.467 --> 00:00:32.124
The receipt is kept with its image and the products it verifies
